{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Sync 把每日計劃與實際行動放在同一條時間軸上，適合想檢視時間運用、找出經常偏移時段的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-17.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>雙軌時間軸對照計劃與實際</h2>\n<p>計劃與實際共用同一時間軸，拖動小時並選擇活動即可記錄；計劃結束時可從通知或小工具按實際情況確認，也可略過。重複計劃、跨午夜計劃、計時器、每週每月每年目標與待辦事項均可設定，讓時間安排與實況並排對照。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-23-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-24-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-25-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-26-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-27-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-28-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Sync: Plan &amp; Actual</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/sync-plan-actual/id6808510515?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:46.506119+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":239,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T13:50:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T19:38:12.080273+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:00.172846+00:00","content_hash":"bb7d3e25b986c65746b710684dd020c3610f160b269798fbc2141a2a02b2f534","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:46.506119+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}